7
00:00:55,920 --> 00:01:00,650
One more step and you'll fall into madness.

8
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:05,650
Don't fall down.

9
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,850
I look towards the top.

10
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:11,490
Chase !

11
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:14,690
Refined to perfection.

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,610
Never retreat, no matter the danger.

13
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,650
I dare to defy the heavens !

14
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:27,490
Always overcome the obstacles,

15
00:01:27,430 --> 00:01:29,850
ignite the seas with blood,

16
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:34,290
bloom through trials and tribulations.

17
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:38,930
Even the sharpest thorns

18
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:43,490
