34
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:32,400
With just a single glance,

35
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:35,970
Shengong Hu
Thunder Celestial Messenger
Illusory Yin
(Originally Corporeal Yang)

36
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,720
