38
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,720
My cultivation even fell to Illusory Yin !

39
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,560
Inside the Heaven Defying Bead,

40
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:45,280
I had the immense opportunity of seeing the third step.

41
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:48,320
I only caught a glimpse

42
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,760
