43
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:52,200
If I can fully open the Heaven Defying Door one day...

44
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:54,440
I can't even imagine...

45
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:59,120
The gaze that nearly shattered my soul

46
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,680
