49
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:09,360
I pay respects to Senior.

50
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,680
What is it ?

51
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:12,920
Senior,

52
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,730
Junior's name is Shengong Hu,

53
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:17,410
I'm a member of the Shengong Family of the Southern Domain of Allheaven.

54
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:19,160
I'm also a rank 2 Thunder Celestial Messenger

55
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:21,120
