58
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,200
Pledge ?

59
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:27,480
Junior

60
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:28,970
knows his cultivation is still shallow.

61
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:30,720
He was frightened by the pressure of my comprehension,

62
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,730
I am not qualified to rely on Senior.

63
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,920
that's why he's saying all this...

64
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,250
But...

65
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:34,650
There are many cultivation families that rely on their younger generations.

66
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:35,080
But I'm afraid that

67
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:36,960
I can't perform it again.

68
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:36,970
If Senior has any requests,

69
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:39,800
This Shengong Hu has already reached Corporeal Yang.

70
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,810
I'll do my best to fulfill them !

71
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:42,370
The heavens can bear witness

72
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,410
