77
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:48,680
I refuse.

78
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,400
Senior,

79
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:56,560
Junior is willing to offer his Dao Soul

80
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:57,600
along with his Dao Heart as proof.

81
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,280
I beg Senior,

82
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:00,840
