83
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:03,280
He's even offering his Dao Soul !?

84
00:05:03,520 --> 00:05:04,960
With his Dao Soul in hand,

85
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:07,240
I don't need to fear him turning on me.

86
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:10,360
This guy is pretty decisive.

87
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:14,280
You won't regret this ?

88
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,280
Junior will never regret it !

89
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,000
Why did you come here ?

90
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,880
The Thunder Celestial Realm is about to open.

91
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,640
Junior plans to cultivate here

92
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:26,880
