93
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:29,120
I'm not from Allheaven.

94
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:32,920
I don't know when the Thunder Celestial Realm will open.

95
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,560
In about 30 years.

96
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:37,000
By then, one can enter with a Thunder Cauldron.

97
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:38,680
30 years ?

98
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,720
The Rain Celestial Realm back then

99
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:44,200
laid the foundation for my campaign across the star systems.

100
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:47,040
No matter what happens,

101
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:50,280
I must visit the Thunder Celestial Realm.

102
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,800
What are the cultivation restrictions

103
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,800
