104
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,800
Senior,

105
00:05:58,040 --> 00:06:00,280
Peak Late stage Ascendant and below

106
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,320
are allowed to enter.

107
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,360
But the Thunder Celestial Temple has a secret method

108
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:05,480
to allow second step cultivators

109
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:06,560
to also enter.

110
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:08,160
However, while inside,

111
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:11,360
