112
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:12,400
or else

113
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:14,400
it will trigger the collapse of the fragment.

114
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:19,680
In that case...

115
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:28,480
70 steps !?

116
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,410
80 steps !

117
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:32,600
95 steps...

118
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,680
100 steps !

119
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,680
He walked 100 steps forward

120
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,160
as if it were nothing.

121
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:42,360
Senior is indeed an expert who has concealed his cultivation !

122
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:44,840
The gamble I made

123
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:46,320
was correct !

124
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,520
10 steps...

125
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:07,640
For now,

126
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:10,400
my limit is 10 steps.

127
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:15,720
If I were at my peak cultivation,

128
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:18,800
50 steps wouldn't have been a problem.

129
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:25,400
When fighting Thunder Daoist,

130
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:27,720
I used the Heavenly Chop too many times

131
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:30,600
and nearly exhausted my origin energy.

132
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:33,080
For first step cultivators,

133
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:35,450
