134
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,680
Fortunately, with my Thunder Origin Soul,

135
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:42,200
I can use the Thunder Origin Spell to convert this thunder energy into origin energy.

136
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:44,320
I must recover as quickly as possible !

137
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,320
At the 100-steps mark,

138
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:48,400
