139
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,240
If it were me,

140
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,240
my Origin Soul would have been severely damaged.

141
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,440
Senior's cultivation

142
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:56,280
is unfathomable !

143
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:04,010
2 years later

144
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,720
At the edge of the pool,

145
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:09,560
