148
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:17,160
To recover quickly,

149
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,000
I must go deeper !

150
00:08:20,440 --> 00:08:21,320
He moved !

151
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:23,320
Senior is finally going to move again !

152
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:25,400
Those 2 years of waiting

153
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:27,240
were just for this moment !

154
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:30,600
If I can catch even a glimpse of Senior's spells,

155
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:32,720
it will be a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity !

156
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,800
The thunder energy here

157
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,760
is astonishing.

158
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,720
10 steps...

159
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:50,280
Senior moved again

160
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,760
but how could he only walk 10 steps ?

161
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:55,640
Could that terrifying aura from before

162
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:56,960
have been a coincidence ?

163
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,960
Then my pledge

164
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:02,650
would become the greatest joke of all time !

165
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:06,360
Even with all my strength, I still can't reach the center.

166
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:09,160
My Origin Soul shares the same origin as thunder,

167
00:10:09,520 --> 00:10:11,320
there must be a way to advance.

168
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,680
Same origin, yet repelled ?

169
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,360
Could it be...

170
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:23,120
that the key is not strength

171
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:25,480
but the Dao ?

172
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,640
All phenomena in the universe

173
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,480
originate from within oneself.

174
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,920
If it's not a matter of strength,

175
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:35,200
it's a matter of alignment with the Dao.

176
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:39,050
Only when the Dao is aligned can origin energy be absorbed.

177
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:58,240
He...

178
00:10:58,280 --> 00:10:59,760
