179
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,400
The thunder became his steps

180
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:03,160
as if it was welcoming him !

181
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:05,960
This is the true pinnacle of the Dao of Thunder !

182
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:08,440
I waited 2 years

183
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,720
to see

184
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:12,200
