185
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,080
A glimpse at the third step...

186
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:18,240
A comprehension of the Dao...

187
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,520
Although it wasn't offensive power,

188
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:23,080
it's far more precious

189
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:25,000
than countless spells.

190
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:34,330
This place

191
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,520
