192
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:42,480
Zhan Konglie !

193
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:47,410
Zhan Konglie
Thunder Celestial Messenger
Corporeal Yang

194
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:48,160
A Late stage Ascendant

195
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:50,560
