196
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:56,560
He must possess some extraordinary artifact to resist the thunder !

197
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:58,800
This place is not for you.

198
00:11:58,800 --> 00:11:59,640
Scram !

199
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,640
I wondered who it was,

200
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:04,280
so it's Shengong Hu.

201
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:06,080
My eyesight is poor,

202
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:07,840
I didn't recognize you at first.

203
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:09,600
Your cultivation

204
00:12:09,680 --> 00:12:11,480
has dropped quite a bit.

205
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:12,560
It's none of your business !

206
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:15,840
This young friend looks unfamiliar.

207
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,760
To be able to sit safely in the inner pool,

208
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:20,200
you must have a rare artifact.

209
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:21,840
Why don't you take it out

210
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,760
and let me have a look ?

211
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:25,040
Master,

212
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:25,680
we're doomed !

213
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:27,000
A disaster has fallen from the sky !

214
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:28,000
This guy means trouble.

215
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,440
If we get exposed,

216
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:32,200
everything will be over...

217
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:34,040
Corporeal Yang cultivation ?

218
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:36,800
This man believes I possess a powerful artifact...

219
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:39,160
He will not let this go easily.

220
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,680
In order to show me his loyalty,

221
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:44,080
Shengong Hu will surely defend me.

222
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:47,000
Earlier, due to the disparity in cultivation,

223
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:48,880
I had to go along with him.

224
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:51,360
But today, with my Lord by my side,

225
00:12:51,760 --> 00:12:53,240
why should I fear him ?

226
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:55,240
You have 3 breaths

227
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,440
to scram

228
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:57,600
or you'll die !

229
00:12:58,440 --> 00:13:01,760
You're willing to fight to the death with me

230
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:04,250
for the sake of an Ascendant with an artifact ?

231
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,730
Shengong Hu,

232
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:08,240
what kind of game are you playing ?

233
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,640
Zhan Konglie,

234
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:16,920
