235
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:19,640
I'll see this through to the end !

236
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:21,400
Let me see

237
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,400
what you're really up to !

238
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:34,560
They're fighting !

239
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,880
Since Shen Gong Hu's cultivation dropped,

240
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:38,400
he definitely won't hold on.

241
00:13:38,920 --> 00:13:40,520
If Shengong Hu loses,

242
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:42,840
I will fall into Zhan Konglie's hands.

243
00:13:43,800 --> 00:13:45,080
If I retreat now,

244
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:47,160
Shengong Hu will be suspicious of me

245
00:13:47,640 --> 00:13:49,240
and it will also put me in danger.

246
00:13:57,800 --> 00:13:59,120
Shengong Hu,

247
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,680
I will not help you in this duel.

248
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:04,240
Consider it a test of your pledge to me.

249
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:05,840
If you lose,

250
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,880
I will return your Dao Soul.

251
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:09,920
Rest assured my Lord,

252
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:12,040
Shengong Hu will not disgrace your name !

253
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,720
Lord ?

254
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:17,200
To monopolize the artifact,

255
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:20,520
you've staged such a clumsy act with this kid

256
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:22,880
just to try to scare me, Zhan Konglie ?

257
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,400
What a joke !

258
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:55,120
Such a powerful thunder-summoning spell !

259
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:58,130
He used origin energy to summon heavenly thunder.

260
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:00,730
It's like the Furnace Becomes the World spell.

261
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:03,160
His mastery of the spell

262
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:04,920
seems incomplete.

263
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:08,560
Something isn't harmonious in this spell.

264
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:14,920
I've found the way out

265
00:15:15,320 --> 00:15:16,560
of this situation.

266
00:15:45,640 --> 00:15:46,560
Go !

267
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:16,600
I've always hated you.

268
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:18,360
After testing you today,

269
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:20,320
you do have some skill after all !

270
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:22,480
Shengong Hu,

271
00:16:22,680 --> 00:16:25,360
your origin spell contained the power of thunder

272
00:16:25,560 --> 00:16:27,800
but not the soul of thunder.

273
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:31,000
Although your Dao Heart fused with it,

274
00:16:31,160 --> 00:16:34,280
it isn’t enough. Your faith lacks the power of thunder.

275
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:36,800
My Lord is right,

276
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:38,840
this is Junior's bottleneck.

277
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,800
I beg my Lord for guidance !

278
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:43,840
Merging the Dao Heart with thunder...

279
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:45,160
who doesn't know that ?

280
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:47,200
But the cultivation path is uncertain,

281
